+    # wdl/TrainRDGenotyping.wdl `MakeTrainingBed` -> /opt/RdTest/train_hg38_reviewed_final.bed;
+    # hg19: 1kg.train.loci.bed). Feeding a batch's condensed intervals instead makes the fit
